WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
In Markup, draw a rectangle around the area to review.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Select the rectangle to adjust its border.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Choose Text and add a short comment on the page.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Set the text colour and position the comment.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.370
Adjust the comment size and check its placement.
